[{"id":"x-2072003346873880907","post_id":"2072003346873880907","platform":"x","author":"nayibbukele","original_url":"https://x.com/nayibbukele/status/2072003346873880907","published_at":"2026-06-30T17:04:28.512Z","published_date":"2026-06-30","date_precision":"millisecond","source_ids":["nitter-public-timeline"],"text":"Llevamos 28 horas tratando de rescatar de los escombros a Hernán Alberto Gil Flores, de 44 años, quien permanece atrapado en el centro comercial Galerías Playa Grande.\n\nEquipos de varios países nos están ayudando a lograrlo, ya que la complejidad de la estructura, su inestabilidad, las lluvias de ayer y las réplicas han hecho de este uno de los rescates más difíciles que hemos enfrentado.\n\nSin embargo, a pesar de todas estas dificultades, Hernán continúa respondiendo y hemos logrado mantenerlo hidratado, por lo que tenemos la esperanza de que este rescate será un éxito.\n\nCon la ayuda de Dios, lo lograremos.","post_kind":"original","is_repost":false,"author_verified":true,"like_count":45838,"likes_captured_at":"2026-10-28T23:51:54.990547+00:00","likes_source":{"provider":"nitter-public-timeline","url":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/nayibbukele/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYT51__oYLAAIAAAATMjA3NTA0MjA2MDI5ODU1NTQ3MQgAAwAAAAIAAA","sha256":"870a94e8b768068640a2bb45056b37ad22524acdd60e2b75e9b1ad21d3b33030","count_precision":"exact-displayed-integer","capture_precision":"collection-run-start","selection_policy":"latest-known-snapshot; minimum on same-time conflict"},"text_status":"captured_displayed_source_text","text_source":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/nayibbukele/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYT51__oYLAAIAAAATMjA3NTA0MjA2MDI5ODU1NTQ3MQgAAwAAAAIAAA","text_truncated":false},{"id":"x-2071801384442175633","post_id":"2071801384442175633","platform":"x","author":"nayibbukele","original_url":"https://x.com/nayibbukele/status/2071801384442175633","published_at":"2026-06-30T03:41:56.916Z","published_date":"2026-06-30","date_precision":"millisecond","source_ids":["nitter-public-timeline"],"text":"Luego de 5 horas logramos rescatar a esta perrita que responde al nombre de Giselle, en Residencial El Palmar, Caraballeda.\n\nSi alguien es su dueño, puede acercarse a nuestros equipos en la zona y demostrar con fotos o videos que es suya.","post_kind":"original","is_repost":false,"author_verified":true,"like_count":36782,"likes_captured_at":"2026-10-28T23:51:54.990547+00:00","likes_source":{"provider":"nitter-public-timeline","url":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/nayibbukele/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYT51__oYLAAIAAAATMjA3NTA0MjA2MDI5ODU1NTQ3MQgAAwAAAAIAAA","sha256":"870a94e8b768068640a2bb45056b37ad22524acdd60e2b75e9b1ad21d3b33030","count_precision":"exact-displayed-integer","capture_precision":"collection-run-start","selection_policy":"latest-known-snapshot; minimum on same-time conflict"},"text_status":"captured_displayed_source_text","text_source":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/nayibbukele/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYT51__oYLAAIAAAATMjA3NTA0MjA2MDI5ODU1NTQ3MQgAAwAAAAIAAA","text_truncated":false},{"id":"x-2071772169223262455","post_id":"2071772169223262455","platform":"x","author":"nayibbukele","original_url":"https://x.com/nayibbukele/status/2071772169223262455","published_at":"2026-06-30T01:45:51.465Z","published_date":"2026-06-30","date_precision":"millisecond","source_ids":["nitter-public-timeline"],"text":"Nuestros equipos han logrado llegar hasta Hernán Alberto Gil Flores, de 44 años, quien permanece atrapado entre los escombros, en el centro comercial Galerías Playa Grande.\n\nYa se estableció contacto con él, en este momento, se le está suministrando agua a través de una manguera mientras continúan las labores para lograr su rescate.\n\nSeguimos trabajando sin descanso y con la esperanza de ponerlo a salvo.\n\nFuerza Venezuela 🇸🇻🇻🇪","post_kind":"original","is_repost":false,"author_verified":true,"like_count":33330,"likes_captured_at":"2026-10-28T23:51:54.990547+00:00","likes_source":{"provider":"nitter-public-timeline","url":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/nayibbukele/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYT51__oYLAAIAAAATMjA3NTA0MjA2MDI5ODU1NTQ3MQgAAwAAAAIAAA","sha256":"870a94e8b768068640a2bb45056b37ad22524acdd60e2b75e9b1ad21d3b33030","count_precision":"exact-displayed-integer","capture_precision":"collection-run-start","selection_policy":"latest-known-snapshot; minimum on same-time conflict"},"text_status":"captured_displayed_source_text","text_source":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/nayibbukele/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYT51__oYLAAIAAAATMjA3NTA0MjA2MDI5ODU1NTQ3MQgAAwAAAAIAAA","text_truncated":false},{"id":"x-2071746108443767278","post_id":"2071746108443767278","platform":"x","author":"nayibbukele","original_url":"https://x.com/nayibbukele/status/2071746108443767278","published_at":"2026-06-30T00:02:18.091Z","published_date":"2026-06-30","date_precision":"millisecond","source_ids":["nitter-public-timeline"],"text":"Cada hora que pasa sentimos que las esperanzas van disminuyendo.\n\nMuchos nos dicen que estamos buscando en lugares donde ya no hay posibilidades de encontrar personas con vida. Sin embargo, muchos venezolanos nos han pedido que no nos rindamos, y no lo hemos hecho.\n\nSeguiremos buscando mientras exista la más mínima posibilidad, por pequeña que sea.\n\nEstamos buscando a Hernán, a Lucas. Estamos en La Gabarra, en Palafito del Mar, en Coral Bella y en otros lugares, con la esperanza de que Dios quiera darnos un milagro más.\n\nFuerza Venezuela 🇸🇻🇻🇪","post_kind":"original","is_repost":false,"author_verified":true,"like_count":49805,"likes_captured_at":"2026-10-28T23:51:54.990547+00:00","likes_source":{"provider":"nitter-public-timeline","url":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/nayibbukele/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYT51__oYLAAIAAAATMjA3NTA0MjA2MDI5ODU1NTQ3MQgAAwAAAAIAAA","sha256":"870a94e8b768068640a2bb45056b37ad22524acdd60e2b75e9b1ad21d3b33030","count_precision":"exact-displayed-integer","capture_precision":"collection-run-start","selection_policy":"latest-known-snapshot; minimum on same-time conflict"},"text_status":"captured_displayed_source_text","text_source":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/nayibbukele/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYT51__oYLAAIAAAATMjA3NTA0MjA2MDI5ODU1NTQ3MQgAAwAAAAIAAA","text_truncated":false},{"id":"x-2071552309897679035","post_id":"2071552309897679035","platform":"x","author":"nayibbukele","original_url":"https://x.com/nayibbukele/status/2071552309897679035","published_at":"2026-06-29T11:12:12.917Z","published_date":"2026-06-29","date_precision":"millisecond","source_ids":["nitter-public-timeline"],"text":"Después de intensas horas de trabajo conjunto, Aaron Levi Cantillo Vargas, de 21 años, ha sido rescatado con vida del edificio OPP 25, en el sector Tanaguarena, parroquia Caraballeda, estado de La Guaira.\n\nEste rescate fue posible gracias al esfuerzo coordinado de los equipos de rescate de Venezuela, México y El Salvador, que trabajaron sin descanso para llegar hasta Aaron. \n\nAaron ya recibe atención médica especializada.\n\nGracias Dios por permitir este milagro. \n\nSeguimos trabajando con la esperanza de poder salvar más vidas.\n\n🇸🇻🇻🇪","post_kind":"quote","is_repost":false,"author_verified":true,"like_count":32559,"likes_captured_at":"2026-10-28T23:51:54.990547+00:00","likes_source":{"provider":"nitter-public-timeline","url":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/nayibbukele/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYT51__oYLAAIAAAATMjA3NTA0MjA2MDI5ODU1NTQ3MQgAAwAAAAIAAA","sha256":"870a94e8b768068640a2bb45056b37ad22524acdd60e2b75e9b1ad21d3b33030","count_precision":"exact-displayed-integer","capture_precision":"collection-run-start","selection_policy":"latest-known-snapshot; minimum on same-time conflict"},"text_status":"captured_displayed_source_text","text_source":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/nayibbukele/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYT51__oYLAAIAAAATMjA3NTA0MjA2MDI5ODU1NTQ3MQgAAwAAAAIAAA","text_truncated":false},{"id":"x-2071518532311867489","post_id":"2071518532311867489","platform":"x","author":"nayibbukele","original_url":"https://x.com/nayibbukele/status/2071518532311867489","published_at":"2026-06-29T08:57:59.713Z","published_date":"2026-06-29","date_precision":"millisecond","source_ids":["nitter-public-timeline"],"text":"Actualización sobre Aaron:\n\nTodo indica que se encuentra en buen estado y con buen ánimo. Aunque no podremos confirmarlo con certeza hasta que logremos sacarlo de los escombros, es una excelente señal y nos da muchas probabilidades de éxito.\n\nPrimero Dios, lograremos salvar otra vida.\n\nFuerza Venezuela 🇸🇻🇻🇪","post_kind":"original","is_repost":false,"author_verified":true,"like_count":6397,"likes_captured_at":"2026-10-28T23:51:54.990547+00:00","likes_source":{"provider":"nitter-public-timeline","url":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/nayibbukele/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYT51__oYLAAIAAAATMjA3NTA0MjA2MDI5ODU1NTQ3MQgAAwAAAAIAAA","sha256":"870a94e8b768068640a2bb45056b37ad22524acdd60e2b75e9b1ad21d3b33030","count_precision":"exact-displayed-integer","capture_precision":"collection-run-start","selection_policy":"latest-known-snapshot; minimum on same-time conflict"},"text_status":"captured_displayed_source_text","text_source":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/nayibbukele/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYT51__oYLAAIAAAATMjA3NTA0MjA2MDI5ODU1NTQ3MQgAAwAAAAIAAA","text_truncated":false},{"id":"x-2071505577969123388","post_id":"2071505577969123388","platform":"x","author":"nayibbukele","original_url":"https://x.com/nayibbukele/status/2071505577969123388","published_at":"2026-06-29T08:06:31.157Z","published_date":"2026-06-29","date_precision":"millisecond","source_ids":["nitter-public-timeline"],"text":"Hemos recibido cientos de mensajes que nos dicen que hay unos niños con vida soterrados en el edificio Coral Beach.\n\nNo sabemos si la información es correcta, pero los mensajes son muchos.\n\n¡Vamos para allá!","post_kind":"original","is_repost":false,"author_verified":true,"like_count":70363,"likes_captured_at":"2026-10-28T23:51:54.990547+00:00","likes_source":{"provider":"nitter-public-timeline","url":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/nayibbukele/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYT51__oYLAAIAAAATMjA3NTA0MjA2MDI5ODU1NTQ3MQgAAwAAAAIAAA","sha256":"870a94e8b768068640a2bb45056b37ad22524acdd60e2b75e9b1ad21d3b33030","count_precision":"exact-displayed-integer","capture_precision":"collection-run-start","selection_policy":"latest-known-snapshot; minimum on same-time conflict"},"text_status":"captured_displayed_source_text","text_source":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/nayibbukele/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYT51__oYLAAIAAAATMjA3NTA0MjA2MDI5ODU1NTQ3MQgAAwAAAAIAAA","text_truncated":false},{"id":"x-2071495775431876843","post_id":"2071495775431876843","platform":"x","author":"nayibbukele","original_url":"https://x.com/nayibbukele/status/2071495775431876843","published_at":"2026-06-29T07:27:34.050Z","published_date":"2026-06-29","date_precision":"millisecond","source_ids":["nitter-public-timeline"],"text":"Nuestros equipos de rescate, junto a rescatistas de México y Venezuela, trabajan para sacar con vida a Aaron Levi Cantillo Vargas, de 21 años, quien permanece atrapado en el edificio OPP 25, en el sector Tanaguarena, parroquia Caraballeda, estado de La Guaira.\n\nYa hemos logrado localizarlo y uno de nuestros médicos logró canalizarle líquidos para mantenerlo hidratado.\n\nLamentablemente, entre nuestros rescatistas y Aaron se encuentra el cuerpo de una persona fallecida, lo que dificulta las labores para llegar hasta él. En este momento trabajamos para recuperar el cuerpo con el mayor respeto y cuidado posible, con la esperanza de poder llegar hasta Aaron en las próximas horas.\n\nNo perdamos la esperanza.\n\nFuerza Venezuela 🇸🇻🇻🇪","post_kind":"original","is_repost":false,"author_verified":true,"like_count":24940,"likes_captured_at":"2026-10-28T23:51:54.990547+00:00","likes_source":{"provider":"nitter-public-timeline","url":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/nayibbukele/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYT51__oYLAAIAAAATMjA3NTA0MjA2MDI5ODU1NTQ3MQgAAwAAAAIAAA","sha256":"870a94e8b768068640a2bb45056b37ad22524acdd60e2b75e9b1ad21d3b33030","count_precision":"exact-displayed-integer","capture_precision":"collection-run-start","selection_policy":"latest-known-snapshot; minimum on same-time conflict"},"text_status":"captured_displayed_source_text","text_source":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/nayibbukele/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYT51__oYLAAIAAAATMjA3NTA0MjA2MDI5ODU1NTQ3MQgAAwAAAAIAAA","text_truncated":false},{"id":"x-2071442504222748754","post_id":"2071442504222748754","platform":"x","author":"nayibbukele","original_url":"https://x.com/nayibbukele/status/2071442504222748754","published_at":"2026-06-29T03:55:53.204Z","published_date":"2026-06-29","date_precision":"millisecond","source_ids":["nitter-public-timeline"],"text":"Hacen que todo valga la pena…\n\n¡Gracias! 🇸🇻🇻🇪","post_kind":"quote","is_repost":false,"author_verified":true,"like_count":41263,"likes_captured_at":"2026-10-28T23:51:54.990547+00:00","likes_source":{"provider":"nitter-public-timeline","url":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/nayibbukele/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYT51__oYLAAIAAAATMjA3NTA0MjA2MDI5ODU1NTQ3MQgAAwAAAAIAAA","sha256":"870a94e8b768068640a2bb45056b37ad22524acdd60e2b75e9b1ad21d3b33030","count_precision":"exact-displayed-integer","capture_precision":"collection-run-start","selection_policy":"latest-known-snapshot; minimum on same-time conflict"},"text_status":"captured_displayed_source_text","text_source":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/nayibbukele/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYT51__oYLAAIAAAATMjA3NTA0MjA2MDI5ODU1NTQ3MQgAAwAAAAIAAA","text_truncated":false},{"id":"x-2071422735738110281","post_id":"2071422735738110281","platform":"x","author":"nayibbukele","original_url":"https://x.com/nayibbukele/status/2071422735738110281","published_at":"2026-06-29T02:37:20.030Z","published_date":"2026-06-29","date_precision":"millisecond","source_ids":["nitter-public-timeline"],"text":"Hemos encontrado con vida a este perrito en Residencias Karina. No sabemos su nombre, pero se encuentra en muy buen estado de salud.\n\nSi alguien es su dueño, por favor acérquese a nuestros equipos y muéstreles alguna fotografía o video en su celular para poder hacerle la entrega.","post_kind":"original","is_repost":false,"author_verified":true,"like_count":45370,"likes_captured_at":"2026-10-28T23:51:54.990547+00:00","likes_source":{"provider":"nitter-public-timeline","url":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/nayibbukele/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYT51__oYLAAIAAAATMjA3NTA0MjA2MDI5ODU1NTQ3MQgAAwAAAAIAAA","sha256":"870a94e8b768068640a2bb45056b37ad22524acdd60e2b75e9b1ad21d3b33030","count_precision":"exact-displayed-integer","capture_precision":"collection-run-start","selection_policy":"latest-known-snapshot; minimum on same-time conflict"},"text_status":"captured_displayed_source_text","text_source":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/nayibbukele/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYT51__oYLAAIAAAATMjA3NTA0MjA2MDI5ODU1NTQ3MQgAAwAAAAIAAA","text_truncated":false},{"id":"x-2071273042529960383","post_id":"2071273042529960383","platform":"x","author":"nayibbukele","original_url":"https://x.com/nayibbukele/status/2071273042529960383","published_at":"2026-06-28T16:42:30.388Z","published_date":"2026-06-28","date_precision":"millisecond","source_ids":["nitter-public-timeline"],"text":"Muchas veces nos dijeron que no había señales de vida, pero la madre de Lucas ha mantenido la fe, y nosotros también.\n\nDurante varios días hemos estado trabajando con menos de un 0.01 % de probabilidades.\n\nPero vamos a seguir. Para Dios no hay nada imposible.","post_kind":"original","is_repost":false,"author_verified":true,"like_count":54525,"likes_captured_at":"2026-10-28T23:51:54.990547+00:00","likes_source":{"provider":"nitter-public-timeline","url":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/nayibbukele/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYT51__oYLAAIAAAATMjA3NTA0MjA2MDI5ODU1NTQ3MQgAAwAAAAIAAA","sha256":"870a94e8b768068640a2bb45056b37ad22524acdd60e2b75e9b1ad21d3b33030","count_precision":"exact-displayed-integer","capture_precision":"collection-run-start","selection_policy":"latest-known-snapshot; minimum on same-time conflict"},"text_status":"captured_displayed_source_text","text_source":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/nayibbukele/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYT51__oYLAAIAAAATMjA3NTA0MjA2MDI5ODU1NTQ3MQgAAwAAAAIAAA","text_truncated":false},{"id":"x-2071268308003725727","post_id":"2071268308003725727","platform":"x","author":"nayibbukele","original_url":"https://x.com/nayibbukele/status/2071268308003725727","published_at":"2026-06-28T16:23:41.589Z","published_date":"2026-06-28","date_precision":"millisecond","source_ids":["nitter-public-timeline"],"text":"Nos acaban de llamar de la clínica donde está Belkys. Su condición es muy estable. Sus médicos nos dicen que estemos tranquilos.\n\nTambién nos informaron que ninguno de ellos cobrará honorarios. Un lindo gesto, como muchos otros que hemos visto todos los días en Venezuela 🇸🇻🇻🇪","post_kind":"original","is_repost":false,"author_verified":true,"like_count":30166,"likes_captured_at":"2026-10-28T23:51:54.990547+00:00","likes_source":{"provider":"nitter-public-timeline","url":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/nayibbukele/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYT51__oYLAAIAAAATMjA3NTA0MjA2MDI5ODU1NTQ3MQgAAwAAAAIAAA","sha256":"870a94e8b768068640a2bb45056b37ad22524acdd60e2b75e9b1ad21d3b33030","count_precision":"exact-displayed-integer","capture_precision":"collection-run-start","selection_policy":"latest-known-snapshot; minimum on same-time conflict"},"text_status":"captured_displayed_source_text","text_source":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/nayibbukele/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYT51__oYLAAIAAAATMjA3NTA0MjA2MDI5ODU1NTQ3MQgAAwAAAAIAAA","text_truncated":false},{"id":"x-2071253210279362824","post_id":"2071253210279362824","platform":"x","author":"nayibbukele","original_url":"https://x.com/nayibbukele/status/2071253210279362824","published_at":"2026-06-28T15:23:42.011Z","published_date":"2026-06-28","date_precision":"millisecond","source_ids":["nitter-public-timeline"],"text":"Belkys ya llegó a la clínica privada en Caracas.\n\nPrimero Dios estará bien 🇸🇻🇻🇪","post_kind":"original","is_repost":false,"author_verified":true,"like_count":17436,"likes_captured_at":"2026-10-28T23:51:54.990547+00:00","likes_source":{"provider":"nitter-public-timeline","url":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/nayibbukele/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYT51__oYLAAIAAAATMjA3NTA0MjA2MDI5ODU1NTQ3MQgAAwAAAAIAAA","sha256":"870a94e8b768068640a2bb45056b37ad22524acdd60e2b75e9b1ad21d3b33030","count_precision":"exact-displayed-integer","capture_precision":"collection-run-start","selection_policy":"latest-known-snapshot; minimum on same-time conflict"},"text_status":"captured_displayed_source_text","text_source":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/nayibbukele/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYT51__oYLAAIAAAATMjA3NTA0MjA2MDI5ODU1NTQ3MQgAAwAAAAIAAA","text_truncated":false},{"id":"x-2071241668771156331","post_id":"2071241668771156331","platform":"x","author":"nayibbukele","original_url":"https://x.com/nayibbukele/status/2071241668771156331","published_at":"2026-06-28T14:37:50.301Z","published_date":"2026-06-28","date_precision":"millisecond","source_ids":["nitter-public-timeline"],"text":"Después de 86  horas de estar atrapada bajo los escombros, y luego de 11 horas de  intenso trabajo, hemos logrado rescatar con vida a Belkys Josefina  Barreto García, de 60 años, quien permaneció bajo los escombros del  edificio Breogan, en Caraballeda.\n\nEste logro fue posible gracias  al esfuerzo y la perseverancia de nuestros rescatistas, quienes  trabajaron sin descanso durante toda la noche y la madrugada, con el  apoyo de rescatistas USAR peruanos.\n\nSin embargo, aunque nuestros  médicos estabilizaron a Belkys en el campamento, su estado de salud aún  es delicado. Por lo que contratamos un helicóptero privado y la  trasladamos a una clínica privada en Caracas, donde ya está recibiendo  la mejor atención posible.\n\nQue Dios la bendiga y le dé fortaleza 🇸🇻🇻🇪","post_kind":"original","is_repost":false,"author_verified":true,"like_count":52186,"likes_captured_at":"2026-10-28T23:51:54.990547+00:00","likes_source":{"provider":"nitter-public-timeline","url":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/nayibbukele/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYT51__oYLAAIAAAATMjA3NTA0MjA2MDI5ODU1NTQ3MQgAAwAAAAIAAA","sha256":"870a94e8b768068640a2bb45056b37ad22524acdd60e2b75e9b1ad21d3b33030","count_precision":"exact-displayed-integer","capture_precision":"collection-run-start","selection_policy":"latest-known-snapshot; minimum on same-time conflict"},"text_status":"captured_displayed_source_text","text_source":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/nayibbukele/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYT51__oYLAAIAAAATMjA3NTA0MjA2MDI5ODU1NTQ3MQgAAwAAAAIAAA","text_truncated":false}]